											https://orcid.org/0009-0006-6682-1823
										</a>
									</div>
															</div>
													<div class="author">
								<strong>Juan Ferrero</strong>
																	<div class="article-author-affilitation">
										University of Bath, Reino Unido.
									</div>
																									<div class="orcid">
										
										<a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9713-7534" target="_blank">
